<!--
  A feed that still lists posts but has stopped carrying any of them.

  This is what a Medium-style feed looks like the day the publisher switches
  it to titles-only, and it is the failure FR-10 has to catch. Under a
  feed-only terms ruling the feed body IS the yield, so `items_kept` counts
  entries that carry a body — not entries that exist. Without that
  distinction this feed reports a full yield while delivering nothing.

  Whitespace-only content on the second entry on purpose: an empty
  `content:encoded` is not the same shape as an absent one, and both have to
  count as nothing.
-->
